msgctxt "3940"
msgid "So, how old are you, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3952"
msgid "How old do I look?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3964"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3976"
msgid ""
"I'd say you're in your late 30s. You look like someone who married young "
"and has children."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3988"
msgid "...I do have someone who's like a daughter to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4000"
msgid "It sounds like a sensitive topic. Perhaps I shouldn't have asked..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4012"
msgid "Oh, no, it's nothing like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4072"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4084"
msgid "Haruka-chan, is it? I'd love to meet her! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4096"
msgid "...Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4108"
msgid "In some ways, I think we're very much alike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4120"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4132"
msgid "I actually have a son; I'm a divorced single mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4144"
msgid "Hehe, oops. Guess I let that slip. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4156"
msgid "You what now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4168"
msgid "Oh! I'm sorry. Does that make you uncomfortable?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4180"
msgid "No, I don't really mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4192"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4204"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4216"
msgid "I'm not quite sure how to explain it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4228"
msgid "I've been hiding it all this time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4240"
msgid "But it feels great to finally get it off my chest. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4252"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4264"
msgid ""
"I even hide it from the club, but maybe it would be better if I was more "
"open about being divorced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4276"
msgid "It should be fine, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4288"
msgid "Do you really think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4300"
msgid "Probably..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4312"
msgid "Yeah, you're right! There's nothing wrong with it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4324"
msgid ""
"I hate having to keep it hidden from guests... I wouldn't want someone to "
"hide that from me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4336"
msgid "You know, after talking to you about it, my anxiety feels so trivial."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4348"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4360"
msgid "Okay, I'm going to tell everyone tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4372"
msgid "Thank you so much, Kiryu-san! ♪ You made my night! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4384"
msgid "Let's keep it between us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4396"
msgid "Hehe. ♪ Oh, stop! You're making me blush. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4408"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4420"
msgid "You looked all shy when you said that, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4432"
msgid "It's adorable. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4444"
msgid "Oh, I, uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4456"
msgid "But... On that note..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4468"
msgid ""
"I hate feeling like I have to hide these things from our guests. I wouldn't "
"want someone to hide that from me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4480"
msgid "Yeah, I get that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4492"
msgid "You know, after talking to you about it, my anxiety feels so trivial."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4504"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4516"
msgid "Okay, I'm going to tell everyone tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4528"
msgid "Thank you so much, Kiryu-san! ♪ You made my night! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4540"
msgid "You should wait for the right time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4552"
msgid "I see. You think I should approach this carefully..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4564"
msgid "Hopefully, there will be people who understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4576"
msgid ""
"You're worried about me, then? ♪ I'm really happy to hear that. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4588"
msgid "The other girls here are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4600"
msgid "Well... I think they're okay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4612"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4624"
msgid "You know, after talking to you about it, my anxiety feels so trivial."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4636"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4648"
msgid "Okay, I'm going to tell everyone tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4660"
msgid "Thank you so much, Kiryu-san! ♪ You made my night! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4672"
msgid "Sometimes, I get mood swings that tire me out and make me, well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4684"
msgid "Not want to see people..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4696"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4708"
msgid "It's in times like those my son is a total lifesaver."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4720"
msgid "Whenever I'm feeling down, he'll say things like,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4732"
msgid ""
"\"Mom, you changed your nails,\" or \"You look really nice today!\" "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4744"
msgid "He sounds like a good kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4756"
msgid "He is! I'm only here today because of him. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4768"
msgid "Heh. That's nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4780"
msgid ""
"Honestly! I just want to hug him tight all day long! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4792"
msgid "Hug me, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4804"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! Are you drunk already?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4816"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4828"
msgid ""
"I don't like being hit on like that. It doesn't suit you either, "
"Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4840"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4852"
msgid "Wouldn't you rather be hugged?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4864"
msgid "Hehe. Yes, I would. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4876"
msgid "That said, I am already surrounded by my son's love..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4888"
msgid "So it's almost like he's hugging me all the time. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4900"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4912"
msgid "I'm jealous of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4924"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4936"
msgid "You're jealous of a four-year-old boy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4948"
msgid "You're funny, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4960"
msgid "...I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4972"
msgid "I'd be happy to give you a hug."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4984"
msgid ""
"But I'd much rather be swept up in your arms, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4996"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5008"
msgid "Will you hear me out, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5020"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5032"
msgid "My friend is starting her own club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5044"
msgid "And she's asked me if I want to work with her..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5056"
msgid "Is that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5068"
msgid "My parents are getting along in years, so when I think of my son..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5080"
msgid "I can't help but wonder if that would be the best option for him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5092"
msgid "Do you really believe that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5104"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5116"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5128"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5140"
msgid ""
"To be honest, I don't know... Should I stay here or go home to Shizuoka? "
"I'm not sure which is the right choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5152"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5164"
msgid "This won't do. I can't be like this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5176"
msgid "It's okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5188"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5200"
msgid "Everyone is unsure sometimes. You're allowed to feel this way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5212"
msgid ""
"You're right! I'm still young! It's okay to be unsure about the future "
"sometimes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5224"
msgid "Heh, exactly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5236"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I feel much better again after talking to\r\n"
"you, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5248"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5260"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5272"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5284"
msgid "Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5296"
msgid "Never mind! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5308"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5320"
msgid "It's a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5332"
msgid "I thought so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5344"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5356"
msgid "But if I go, I won't be able to see you anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5368"
msgid "And we just got to know each other..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5380"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5392"
msgid "...What is this feeling?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5404"
msgid "Even if it was a dream..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5416"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5428"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5440"
msgid "No, never mind... I must have gotten the wrong idea..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5452"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5464"
msgid "Don't go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5476"
msgid "Huh!? Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5488"
msgid "Wouldn't it be a better environment for my son to grow up in?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5500"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5512"
msgid "We can't keep living like this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5524"
msgid "That's true, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5536"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5548"
msgid "Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5560"
msgid "Do you feel the same way that I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5572"
msgid "Yeah... Probably..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5584"
msgid "Kiryu-san! ♪ I'm so happy to hear that. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5596"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5608"
msgid "The other day, my friend introduced me to someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5620"
msgid "Someone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5632"
msgid "She's a single mother like me. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5644"
msgid "Oh, that's nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5656"
msgid "I know, right!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5668"
msgid ""
"I've been shouldering all this anxiety by myself, so it felt like a huge "
"weight off my back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5680"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5692"
msgid "For example..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5704"
msgid ""
"We traded ideas about daily struggles like picking up kids from school or "
"getting them to take naps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5716"
msgid ""
"We even talked about managing household expenses. It was so exciting! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5728"
msgid "That must've been nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5740"
msgid "I feel the same way about meeting you, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5752"
msgid "I treasure being able to meet someone like that; it really hits home for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5764"
msgid "And it's incredibly reassuring!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5776"
msgid "Yeah, it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5788"
msgid "I know! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5800"
msgid "It's so nice to have someone who understands how you feel!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5812"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5824"
msgid "But sometimes, when I start thinking about where I am and what I'm doing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5836"
msgid "I can't help but be anxious..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5848"
msgid "Normally, I'm working so hard, I'm too busy to notice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5860"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5872"
msgid "You need to do more than just meet people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5884"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5896"
msgid "Once you meet someone, you have to change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5908"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5920"
msgid "Right... I know that, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5932"
msgid ""
"Don't you think you can gain even just a little courage from running into "
"someone who's been through the same challenges?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5944"
msgid "You have a point..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5956"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5968"
msgid "I want to help you, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5980"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5992"
msgid "You're here listening to me! I think you're already doing plenty! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6004"
msgid "...You do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6016"
msgid "Yes! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6028"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6040"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you have this sort of..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6052"
msgid "...Shadow about you. It makes you stand out from the other men I've met. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6064"
msgid "Oh, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6076"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6088"
msgid "Is it weird of me to think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6100"
msgid ""
"I must admit, I'm drawn to that \"wounded soul\" type... Maybe I could be "
"the one to comfort you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6112"
msgid "Then, comfort me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6124"
msgid "Oh! Is that what you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6136"
msgid "Do you think you can?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6148"
msgid "Hmm... Now that you insist, I'm not sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6160"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6172"
msgid "That's not who I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6184"
msgid "Aww... ♪ Sure you are! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6196"
msgid "You know, I'm not the only one who thinks that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6208"
msgid "To most women, a man like you is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6220"
msgid "Never mind. Forget I said anything! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6232"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6244"
msgid "Please, you're embarrassing me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6256"
msgid ""
"Ooh! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> That's adorable, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6268"
msgid "I like it when you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6280"
msgid "Never mind. Forget I said anything! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6304"
msgid "Do you ever read novels, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6316"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6328"
msgid ""
"If I had to choose, I'd say that I prefer reading things that aren't from a "
"series..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6340"
msgid "Like essay collections or spiritual books. I read a lot of those."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6352"
msgid "But lately, I've been into novels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6364"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6376"
msgid "They're pretty addicting. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6388"
msgid ""
"The one I'm reading right now is about a woman who gets into a lot of "
"affairs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6400"
msgid "The main character is just like me! ♪ Hehehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6412"
msgid "Affairs..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6424"
msgid "Hehehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6436"
msgid ""
"And so, she follows a path of childbirth, divorce, romance, and "
"reassimilating to society, followed by another romance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6448"
msgid "In doing so, she gradually awakens her inner lover. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6460"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6472"
msgid ""
"She comes to depend on her lover, and steadily loses sight of herself, "
"having become addicted to the lifestyle..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6484"
msgid "I think I understand where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6496"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6508"
msgid "What should we do now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6520"
msgid "You're making me kinda nervous..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6532"
msgid "Hehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Are you blushing, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6544"
msgid "No, I just drank a bit too much..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6556"
msgid ""
"Hehehehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm not your lover yet, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6568"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6580"
msgid "I get how she feels, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6592"
msgid "Whaaat? Do you get into affairs a lot too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6604"
msgid "Heh... Something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6616"
msgid "Really? I had you pegged for a more old-fashioned kind of guy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6628"
msgid "I'm just kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6640"
msgid "What do you think we should do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6652"
msgid "Ahahaha, I don't know! That's why I'm asking you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6664"
msgid "Right... Anyway, that's just in the book, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6676"
msgid "Well, yeah... But, still, I can't help but feel that she's just like me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6688"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6700"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you don't really change after you've been drinking, do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6712"
msgid "I'm not sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6724"
msgid "I get drunk pretty easily, but I love drinking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6736"
msgid "It makes me so excited, and I always have a lot of fun! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6748"
msgid "That's good... I think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6760"
msgid "Well, the day after's usually a struggle..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6772"
msgid "I feel so depressed, I want to die..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6784"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6796"
msgid "I wonder that myself. Still, I sure do feel down sometimes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6808"
msgid ""
"That's why I try to hold back on the alcohol, but more often than not, I "
"end up drinking a lot anyway..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6820"
msgid "It's a vicious cycle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6832"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6844"
msgid "I've never really known how to moderate myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6856"
msgid "I'm often impressed by people who have good self-control."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6868"
msgid "...Are you done drinking for the night, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6880"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm just getting started! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6892"
msgid "Hahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6904"
msgid "You're exaggerating, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6916"
msgid "Sorry... I was exaggerating, but I really do feel down at times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6928"
msgid ""
"That's why I try to hold back on the alcohol, but more often than not, I "
"end up drinking a lot anyway..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6940"
msgid "It's a vicious cycle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6952"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6964"
msgid "You're probably drinking too much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6976"
msgid "Hmm... Maybe I am..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6988"
msgid "Why don't you hold back on the alcohol?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7000"
msgid "You're right... Keeping it up wouldn't be very good for my health."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7012"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7024"
msgid "I saw something when I was shopping earlier!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7036"
msgid "Matching t-shirts! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> For me and my son!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7048"
msgid "I bought them straight away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7060"
msgid "Heh... That's nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7072"
msgid "But you're supposed to wear the shirts together, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7084"
msgid "I tried to get my son to wear his, but he didn't want to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7096"
msgid "He wouldn't wear it today, either! So I put mine on first and asked..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7108"
msgid "\"Why won't you wear this?\" But, again, he just said that, well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7120"
msgid "He didn't want to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7132"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7144"
msgid "It's not funny..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7156"
msgid "As his mommy, it makes me feel sorta lonely..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7168"
msgid "I can't tell how boys think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7180"
msgid "Maybe he's just embarrassed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7192"
msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7204"
msgid "He already picks out his own clothes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7216"
msgid "When he finds something he likes, his face just lights up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7228"
msgid "Hahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7240"
msgid "That's why I don't think he's just being shy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7252"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7264"
msgid "I am his mommy, after all! ♪ I can tell that much. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7276"
msgid "I know I'd be embarrassed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7288"
msgid "Hehe. ♪ I don't think you'd ever wear matching t-shirts with anyone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7300"
msgid "Oh, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7312"
msgid "Still, I think I'd like to see that. Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7324"
msgid "Hey now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7336"
msgid "He might be in an early rebellious phase."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7348"
msgid "What!? I don't know about that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7360"
msgid ""
"...Still, it makes sense now that I think about it! Do you really think "
"he's being rebellious!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7372"
msgid "Either way, I don't think you need to worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7384"
msgid "You're right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7396"
msgid ""
"People say that a rebellious phase is a necessary part of a healthy "
"childhood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7408"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7420"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7432"
msgid "It sure makes me lonely, though. I wish he'd stay little forever..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7444"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7456"
msgid "Beats me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7468"
msgid "Aww!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7480"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Do I detect a hint of indifference in your voice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7492"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7504"
msgid ""
"If you really didn't know what he's thinking, that's fine. But to not even "
"think about it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7516"
msgid "That makes me kind of sad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7528"
msgid "...I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7540"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7552"
msgid "It's okay. I was being too harsh on you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7564"
msgid "You're just being honest, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7576"
msgid "I think that's what I like about you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7588"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7600"
msgid "I thought about it. I just couldn't figure it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7612"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7624"
msgid "...Maybe I shouldn't talk about my family problems with other people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7636"
msgid "Now I just feel pathetic..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7648"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7660"
msgid "...I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7672"
msgid "Sorry... I caught a cold over the weekend, and I'm not feeling too well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7684"
msgid "Don't push yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7696"
msgid ""
"I'm okay, though! My son can't eat if his mommy doesn't\r\n"
"work hard! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7708"
msgid "That's true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7720"
msgid "Oh, right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7732"
msgid "I put on a mask so that I wouldn't give my son a cold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7744"
msgid "And when I did... He was scared of me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7756"
msgid "Hehehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7768"
msgid "So I drew a mouth on the mask, hoping he wouldn't be afraid anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7780"
msgid "Tiny eyes, too. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7792"
msgid "Eyes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7804"
msgid "But then he was even more scared!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7816"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7828"
msgid "He sounds like a cute kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7840"
msgid "Was he surprised because you didn't look like you normally do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7852"
msgid "That's what I think. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7864"
msgid "He was probably thinking, \"What happened to my mommy?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7876"
msgid "I may be his mother, but I think he's sooo cute when he's like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7888"
msgid "I wish he didn't have to grow up! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7900"
msgid "Haha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7912"
msgid "Children are the best medicine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7924"
msgid "Oooh! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Exactly! It was a real shot in the arm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7936"
msgid "Haha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7948"
msgid "You know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7960"
msgid "When I'm with you, I feel like I can speak openly about my son..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7972"
msgid "I'm glad I have someone who understands. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7984"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7996"
msgid "He must be pretty timid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8008"
msgid "He really is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8020"
msgid "Maybe you're spoiling him too much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8032"
msgid "I don't think I spoil him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8044"
msgid "Do you not like children, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8056"
msgid "No, I don't dislike them at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8068"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8080"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8092"
msgid "Kiryu-san, if tomorrow was the last day on Earth, how would you spend it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8104"
msgid "Let me think..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8116"
msgid "I'm just speaking hypothetically, okay? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8128"
msgid "I'd spend it with someone precious to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8140"
msgid "Ooh! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I knew it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8152"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8164"
msgid "I think I'd be okay if someone precious was by my side, too. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8176"
msgid "It's enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8188"
msgid "I'd do what I always do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8200"
msgid "Ooh! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> That's so like you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8212"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8224"
msgid "Absolutely! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8236"
msgid "Oh, but what do you always do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8248"
msgid "Go drinking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8260"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. ♪ I'm sure you would do that. In fact, I'm willing to bet you'd be "
"completely unfazed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8272"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8284"
msgid "I. Will. Survive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8296"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8308"
msgid "Even if the Earth itself is destroyed, I'll still be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8320"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Are you serious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8332"
msgid "I'm kidding..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8344"
msgid "Oh, you! I was hoping for a serious answer!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8356"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8368"
msgid "Earlier, my son asked me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8380"
msgid "\"Where's Daddy?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8392"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8404"
msgid ""
"Apparently, the theme during drawing time at school this week was "
"\"fathers\"..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8416"
msgid "It's a completely normal subject, of course, but my son couldn't draw it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8428"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8440"
msgid ""
"I could tell him to draw his grandpa, but I think that would be pushing "
"it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8452"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8464"
msgid "Maybe my son really does need a father..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8476"
msgid "You might be right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8488"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8500"
msgid "He must be lonely. If only his father were here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8512"
msgid ""
"Still, that just isn't an option right now. I could perhaps try to find him "
"a father figure, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8524"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8536"
msgid "I'm sorry. I shouldn't be laying this on you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8548"
msgid "It's okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8560"
msgid "He has you. That's enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8572"
msgid ""
"I feel bad for my son, though. As a woman, there are some things I just "
"can't relate to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8584"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8596"
msgid "I'm sorry. I shouldn't be laying this on you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8608"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8620"
msgid "You have nothing to worry about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8632"
msgid "What makes you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8644"
msgid "I was raised in an orphanage..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8656"
msgid "So I would consider it a blessing just to have a mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8668"
msgid "Oh, I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8680"
msgid "I'm sorry. I shouldn't have asked..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8692"
msgid "It's all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8704"
msgid ""
"Times may seem tough right now, but I'm sure we'll be fine if I keep it "
"together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8716"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8728"
msgid "I'm so glad I asked you for advice, Kiryu-san! Thank you! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8740"
msgid "Good luck. I'm sure you'll be just fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8752"
msgid "Can I ask you something, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8764"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8776"
msgid "Have you ever decided to just give up on falling in love?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8788"
msgid "...Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8800"
msgid ""
"Well, I married for love and had a child. I thought that's all I needed to "
"be happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8812"
msgid "But the struggles keep coming one after another..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8824"
msgid "I guess my life goal wasn't just to get married, after all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8836"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8848"
msgid ""
"Actually, I think I've convinced myself that I can't love again because I'm "
"too afraid, not because I've given up on falling in love altogether."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8860"
msgid "You're overthinking it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8872"
msgid "What!? Maybe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8884"
msgid "But don't I need to be strong to have a proper relationship with someone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8896"
msgid "I want to love and be loved..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8908"
msgid "But I also want more than that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8920"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8932"
msgid "I'm afraid of romance, and I'm going crazy again because of it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8944"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8956"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8968"
msgid "What!? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8980"
msgid "You're scared, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8992"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9004"
msgid "Then, why force yourself into something you don't want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9016"
msgid ""
"...Yeah. You're right! I'm not going to force myself into a romance just "
"because!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9028"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9040"
msgid "It's a relief to hear that from you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9052"
msgid "I wonder why... Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9064"
msgid "Heh. Who knows?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9076"
msgid "You'll change if you learn to love again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9088"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9100"
msgid "I already have some pretty deep scars, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9112"
msgid "Those will heal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9124"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9136"
msgid "It's a relief to hear that from you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9148"
msgid "I feel a little more relaxed now. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9160"
msgid "Heh. Glad to hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9172"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9184"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9196"
msgid "If I ever decide that I am ready to love again one day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9208"
msgid ""
"Then, I hope you'll be there waiting for me, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9220"
msgid "Heheh. You can count on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9232"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Listen to this! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9244"
msgid "You sure seem happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9256"
msgid "Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Is it that obvious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9268"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9280"
msgid "Today is my son's fourth birthday! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9292"
msgid "So, I got him a toy car as a present!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9304"
msgid "He was so excited! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9316"
msgid "I'll bet that made him happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9328"
msgid "No, it's him who's made me happy! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9340"
msgid ""
"I'm sure it was the same for your mother, too! She must have felt blessed "
"to have you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9352"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9364"
msgid "Of course! ♪ I'm a mom, too, so I'd know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9376"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9388"
msgid "But, you know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9400"
msgid "I feel we've been trying our very best to survive these past four years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9412"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, I've felt lost... And other times, I've had a lot people there "
"to support me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9424"
msgid "I need to show them my appreciation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9436"
msgid "I agree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9448"
msgid "He's still only four...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9460"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9472"
msgid ""
"He may be four years old, but he's been through a lot... I feel like we've "
"been trying our very best to survive these past four years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9484"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9496"
msgid "Honestly, so much has happened..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9508"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, I've felt lost... And other times, I've had a lot people there "
"to support me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9520"
msgid "I need to show them my appreciation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9532"
msgid "I agree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9544"
msgid "You know, it's my birthday too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9556"
msgid "Huh? Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9568"
msgid "Yeah. In my past life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9580"
msgid "Ahahahaha. Who were you in your past life, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9592"
msgid "I think I was probably a gorilla."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9604"
msgid "Ahahahaha. You say the funniest things, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9616"
msgid "Heh. I'm just kidding, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9628"
msgid ""
"Still, it feels like we've been trying our very best to survive these past "
"four years, despite feeling really lost at times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9640"
msgid ""
"There's been a lot of people who have helped me along the way, so I think I "
"need to show them my appreciation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9652"
msgid "That so...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9664"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, have you ever thought what your life would be like if things had "
"gone differently?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9676"
msgid "I'm not sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9688"
msgid "In my case..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9700"
msgid ""
"I gave birth, got divorced, and have been trying my best to survive ever "
"since..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9712"
msgid ""
"So I haven't exactly had the luxury to contemplate fantasies like that... "
"Still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9724"
msgid "It does come to mind from time to time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9736"
msgid "Maybe if I'd met you sooner, I'd be a happy woman now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9748"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9760"
msgid "Of course, I have my son..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9772"
msgid "So it's impossible for me to live a different life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9784"
msgid "But I am still a woman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9796"
msgid ""
"There are times when I wish I could lean on someone, or that someone would "
"hold me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9808"
msgid "I can always hug you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9820"
msgid "Are you being serious right now, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9832"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Any time you're feeling anxious, I'll always be here to give you a "
"hug."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9844"
msgid "If you do that, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9856"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Thank you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9868"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9880"
msgid "I have times like that, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9892"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9904"
msgid "But I have to remember that this is real life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9916"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9928"
msgid "It's just so heart-wrenching sometimes. I wish I had someone by my side..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9940"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9952"
msgid "Pull yourself together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9964"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9976"
msgid "You're a mother, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9988"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10000"
msgid "I'm a mother. I can't afford to mope around like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10012"
msgid "I'm the only person my son can count on, after all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10024"
msgid "I've got to keep it together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10036"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10048"
msgid "It's just so heart-wrenching sometimes. I wish I had someone by my side..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10060"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10072"
msgid "I'm tired today..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10084"
msgid "How come?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10096"
msgid "My son got hurt at preschool, and I panicked..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10108"
msgid "Is he okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10120"
msgid "Yes, he's fine. It was just a little sprain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10132"
msgid "That's a relief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10144"
msgid "But I imagined the worst..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10156"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10168"
msgid "It feels like my son has gained some weight recently..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10180"
msgid ""
"When I take him home, he says he can't walk and asks me to carry him, and "
"then he usually falls asleep..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10192"
msgid "That's when I realized..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10204"
msgid "I have to raise him into a fine young man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10216"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10228"
msgid "Society would say I'm lacking in many ways..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10240"
msgid "But I want to be a responsible parent for my son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10252"
msgid "That's why I have to give it all I've got."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10264"
msgid "I admire you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10276"
msgid "Please, don't say that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10288"
msgid "Kiryu-san, I think you've led a much harder life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10300"
msgid "Mine doesn't even begin to compare..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10312"
msgid "That's not true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10324"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10336"
msgid "I may have a lot to learn, but I know this much... ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10348"
msgid "I'm happy. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10360"
msgid "Heheh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10372"
msgid "Have you considered relaxing a bit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10384"
msgid "Huh? Do I look tense to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10396"
msgid "You're putting too much pressure on yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10408"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10420"
msgid "Well, I'm all my son has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10432"
msgid ""
"Of course, I know I need to live my life, but I'm really the only person "
"who can take care of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10444"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10456"
msgid "You have to keep trying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10468"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10480"
msgid "I'm sure your son will appreciate it someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10492"
msgid "Thanks, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10504"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm a little drunk today. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10516"
msgid "Heh. It's fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10528"
msgid ""
"Do you remember how I told you about helping my friend out with her new "
"club?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10540"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10552"
msgid "I've been thinking about visiting Shizuoka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10564"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10576"
msgid "So, I might take some time off work for a while..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10588"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10600"
msgid "Are you really going?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10612"
msgid ""
"I haven't made up my mind yet, but I am going to ask my friend about the "
"details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10624"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10636"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10648"
msgid "Well... I'm a little curious..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10660"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Could it be that... you don't want me to "
"go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10672"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10684"
msgid "It'll be lonely not having you around, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10696"
msgid "But that's just the way it is, I guess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10708"
msgid "Yeah... I guess so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10720"
msgid "Where's Shizuoka?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10732"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10744"
msgid "Can you get there within two hours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10756"
msgid "Let me think... Yeah, that sounds about right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10768"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10780"
msgid "It's not that far, then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10792"
msgid "Are you thinking about visiting me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10804"
msgid "Would it be a bother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10816"
msgid "No, not at all! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10828"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10840"
msgid "I can't let you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10852"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10864"
msgid "No... Never mind..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10876"
msgid "I told you before, didn't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10888"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10900"
msgid "When you say things like that, I don't know what to do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10912"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10924"
msgid "I like making men feel better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10936"
msgid "Making them feel better?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10948"
msgid "The customers that come here are normally pretty tired, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10960"
msgid ""
"They say that just being able to have a normal conversation is soothing, "
"but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10972"
msgid ""
"I was actually thinking it might be a good idea to give shoulder massages "
"as well. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10984"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10996"
msgid "Are you feeling tired anywhere, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11008"
msgid "Nope. Not at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11020"
msgid "You don't always have to act so tough, you know. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11032"
msgid "Any fatigue I have completely washes away whenever I drink with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11044"
msgid "You're just like the other customers, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11056"
msgid "Am I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11068"
msgid "Hehehe. I wouldn't mind providing a little extra service just for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11080"
msgid "...Why didn't you say so earlier?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11092"
msgid "Around there, I guess?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11104"
msgid "Where's \"there\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11116"
msgid "...You'd know best, wouldn't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11128"
msgid "C'mon, just tell me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11140"
msgid "...My shoulders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11152"
msgid "Okay then! Here's a special shoulder massage just for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11164"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11176"
msgid "You offer services like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11188"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> It's free! No charge! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11200"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11212"
msgid ""
"Yes! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> But I'd only ever do this for you, "
"Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11224"
msgid "So, how about that massage?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11236"
msgid "Yeah... Please do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11248"
msgid "I heard that a friend of mine is getting married!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11260"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11272"
msgid "But wait until you hear about her fiancé!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11284"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11296"
msgid "My friend is 28 years old, but she's marrying a 46-year-old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11308"
msgid "They're 18 years apart!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11320"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11332"
msgid "What's your ideal age for your partner, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11344"
msgid "For me, the younger, the better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11356"
msgid "Most men prefer that, I suppose..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11368"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11380"
msgid "Am I out of the running, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11392"
msgid "You're still young..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11404"
msgid "You say that, but I'm already 29 years old..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11416"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11428"
msgid "I prefer a more mature woman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11440"
msgid "You mean you like older women?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11452"
msgid ""
"No. I mean that a wealth of experience strengthens a woman's appeal... like "
"an aged cheese or a fine wine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11464"
msgid "It sounds like you're talking more about food..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11476"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11488"
msgid "Age is just a number."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11500"
msgid "Hehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> That's right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11512"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11524"
msgid ""
"How old someone is has nothing to do with your feelings for\r\n"
"them! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11536"
msgid "Heh... Exactly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11548"
msgid "I watched a fighting event the other day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11560"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11572"
msgid ""
"Watching it live really got my heart pumping! You could feel the heat and "
"excitement in the air!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11584"
msgid ""
"The sight of two men pummeling one another is truly something\r\n"
"else! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11596"
msgid "Do you like competitive fighting, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11608"
msgid "Well, I don't dislike them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11620"
msgid ""
"You seem pretty strong, Kiryu-san. You might even win if you fought in the "
"ring!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11632"
msgid "Who do you think you're talking to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11644"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11656"
msgid "I'll never lose, no matter who comes at me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11668"
msgid "That's some impressive confidence..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11680"
msgid ""
"But, yeah, I feel like you really would win every time. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11692"
msgid "Without a doubt..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11704"
msgid "I won't know until I try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11716"
msgid "I'm sure you'll do great, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11728"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11740"
msgid ""
"You seem like the type that will always be the last man standing, even "
"after being beat within an inch of your life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11752"
msgid "...I'd rather not imagine that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11764"
msgid "You're overestimating me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11776"
msgid "I don't think so, Kiryu-san! I feel like you'd really make it if you tried!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11788"
msgid "Do I look like the type to pick fights with people?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11800"
msgid " Oh... That's not really what I meant..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11812"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11824"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11836"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, what do you do when you want to take a break or improve your "
"mood?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11848"
msgid "...I drink, I guess?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11860"
msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11872"
msgid "I can't think of anything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11884"
msgid "Personally, I'm no good at finding ways to relax or feel better..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11896"
msgid "By the time I realize that, I'm usually completely burnt out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11908"
msgid "Often to the point of where I can't even move."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11920"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11932"
msgid "I wish I knew some way to regularly \"recharge\" myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11944"
msgid "I wonder if it's even possible..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11956"
msgid "I don't there's anything you can do about that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11968"
msgid "Oh... I thought you might know, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11980"
msgid "Is it hard to relax when you're drinking with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11992"
msgid ""
"Oh, no, not at all! I'm just weirdly anxious right now. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12004"
msgid "Heh... So this is helping, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12016"
msgid ""
"It definitely is. But I think I might be depending on you too much, "
"Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12028"
msgid "It's not like I mind..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12040"
msgid "Aren't you pushing yourself too hard?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12052"
msgid "I figured that was it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12064"
msgid "No matter how busy you are, you should spend some time for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12076"
msgid "That's the best way to relax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12088"
msgid ""
"You're right. It's easy to forget to take care of myself when I'm swamped "
"with work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12100"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12112"
msgid "I'll recharge you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12124"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12136"
msgid "Heh... You know what I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12148"
msgid "One good spank from me and you'll be at full power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12160"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12172"
msgid "...I don't follow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12184"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12196"
msgid "Quick question, Kiryu-san! How are you supposed to eat natto?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12208"
msgid "Natto?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12220"
msgid "I was chatting with one of the girls earlier..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12232"
msgid "Somehow the conversation turned to natto, and now I feel like eating it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12244"
msgid "With soy sauce and mustard seed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12256"
msgid "So that's how you like it? You have pretty standard tastes, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12268"
msgid "Yeah, I guess so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12280"
msgid "I like adding scallions and mayonnaise! Followed by a drizzle of mentsuyu! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12292"
msgid "You're insulting the image of natto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12304"
msgid "Ahahaha! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Is that bad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12316"
msgid "It's not wrong, but... Wouldn't that overpower the original flavor?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12328"
msgid "But it's yummy! ♪ You should try it sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12340"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12352"
msgid ""
"I think the key is to really lay on the mayo! Hehehehe! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12364"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12376"
msgid "That's quite a combo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12388"
msgid "Heh! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Yeah! It's yummy once you add all that stuff!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12400"
msgid "Yeah, sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12412"
msgid "You should try it for yourself sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12424"
msgid ""
"I think the key is to really lay on the mayo! Hehehehe! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12436"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12448"
msgid "I'm pretty particular about my natto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12460"
msgid "Really!? As it so happens, I am too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12472"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12484"
msgid "I like adding scallions and mayonnaise! Followed by a drizzle of mentsuyu! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12496"
msgid "Mayonnaise? No way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12508"
msgid "Huh!? What are you talking about!? Mayonnaise is what makes it work!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12520"
msgid "I just can't get on board with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12532"
msgid "Aww! But it's good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12544"
msgid "I'll pass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12556"
msgid "Oh. Okay, then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12568"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12580"
msgid "Oh, that sounds tasty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12592"
msgid ""
"I know, right? You can imagine it, can't you? It's an amazing mashup of "
"flavors!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12604"
msgid "Maybe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12616"
msgid "You should try it sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12628"
msgid ""
"I think the key is to really lay on the mayo! Hehehehe! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12640"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12652"
msgid "With sugar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12664"
msgid "Oh yeah, some people like putting sugar in their natto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12676"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12688"
msgid "How do you like yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12700"
msgid "I like adding scallions and mayonnaise! Followed by a drizzle of mentsuyu! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12712"
msgid "Hehehehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12724"
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12736"
msgid "Oh, sorry. ♪ I was just thinking about my son..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12748"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12760"
msgid "There's this girl named Karina-chan at my son's preschool..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12772"
msgid "And I think he likes her! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12784"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12796"
msgid ""
"But he doesn't know what to do about it, so he teases her. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12808"
msgid "And when it's time to say goodbye, he just sorta stares at her. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12820"
msgid "\"Get it together, son!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12832"
msgid ""
"I wish I could say tell him that, but he's just so adorable! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12844"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12856"
msgid "Anyway, once I noticed, I started paying closer attention to my son..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12868"
msgid "And guess what? Sometimes he looks really manly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12880"
msgid ""
"Seeing him like that makes me think that one day he might bring home a girl "
"he likes and say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12892"
msgid "\"Yo, this is my mom.\" At least..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12904"
msgid "That's how I picture it in my mind..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12916"
msgid "Does it make you feel lonely?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12928"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12940"
msgid "I'd be lying if I said no..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12952"
msgid "But it hasn't really happened yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12964"
msgid "Right now, I still have my son all to myself! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12976"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12988"
msgid "Sounds like a dependable kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13000"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13012"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13024"
msgid ""
"If someone like you believes that, then that must mean my son will grow up "
"to be absolutely amazing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13036"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13048"
msgid "Still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13060"
msgid ""
"I wonder what kind of girl he'll date. I hope she's cute. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13072"
msgid "She'll never measure up to his mom, will she?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13084"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> It's nice of you to say so, but that "
"would definitely be a problem for him! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13096"
msgid "Haha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13108"
msgid "You're overthinking it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13120"
msgid "Aww, come on! It's fun to imagine! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13132"
msgid "Haha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13144"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13156"
msgid "Oh! But if he really does get a girlfriend..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13168"
msgid "I won't be able to hug him anymore! And he won't let me kiss him either!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13180"
msgid "You're probably right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13192"
msgid "Oh, no! What should I do, Kiryu-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13204"
msgid "Now I'm really worried..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13216"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13228"
msgid "Kiryu-san, how do you spend your days off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13240"
msgid "I don't really do anything in particular..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13252"
msgid ""
"Well, when I don't have anything planned, I just like to see where life "
"takes me. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13264"
msgid "That right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13276"
msgid "Last week, my son and I ended up at a fish pond. Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13288"
msgid "Did you catch anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13300"
msgid "We did! Both of us caught one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13312"
msgid "We had a lot of fun. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13324"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13336"
msgid ""
"But then it hit me. Whenever I spend time with my son, we make lots of "
"little memories."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13348"
msgid "Little memories?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13360"
msgid ""
"And those memories will add up over time and eventually form a lifetime of "
"experiences."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13372"
msgid "Yeah, definitely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13384"
msgid ""
"I'd like to be with someone who I can make lots of little memories with. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13396"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you've made so many memories for me already. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13408"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13420"
msgid "Hehe. ♪ Did I just catch you blushing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13432"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13444"
msgid "Make them while you can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13456"
msgid "Huh? Why do you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13468"
msgid ""
"One day, you'll have to part ways... Until then, you should do your best to "
"make a lot of memories together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13480"
msgid "That's true... But I don't want to imagine such sad things just yet..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13492"
msgid "My son is only four, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13504"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13516"
msgid "Count me in next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13528"
msgid "Oh, are you coming too? Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13540"
msgid "I'm just kidding. I shouldn't get between a mother and her child."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13552"
msgid "That's right. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13564"
msgid "You'll just have to make some memories with me ahead of time. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13576"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13588"
msgid "Hehe. ♪ It all depends on you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13600"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13612"
msgid "Hehehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13624"
msgid "Well, you look happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13636"
msgid "Oh! ♪ Could you tell?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13648"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13660"
msgid "My son gave me a tiara as a gift. An origami tiara, that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13672"
msgid ""
"He made it during arts and crafts time at preschool. His teacher said he "
"tried really hard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13684"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13696"
msgid ""
"When I imagine him putting that much work into it, my chest gets all tight. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13708"
msgid ""
"I can see him saying, \"I'm gonna put this on Mommy's head,\" while working "
"so hard to fold it all nicely. And then his little hands crown me. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13720"
msgid "There's no other one like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13732"
msgid "Yeah! Exactly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13744"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13756"
msgid "I feel so fortunate to have had my son."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13768"
msgid ""
"But even more than that, I feel lucky to have even been born\r\n"
"at all. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13780"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13792"
msgid "You seem truly happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13804"
msgid "And then he kissed me on the cheek. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13816"
msgid ""
"I couldn't stop myself from wrapping him up in a hug! Hehehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13828"
msgid "Nice, nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13840"
msgid ""
"I wonder... Was he planning to make me happy? Does he even understand "
"things like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13852"
msgid ""
"Oh, but... What if it has nothing to with me being his mommy? What if he's "
"just a natural-born ladies' man?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13864"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13876"
msgid "Oh...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13888"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13900"
msgid "...Sorry. I'm just rambling at this point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13912"
msgid "No, don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13924"
msgid "Your son is very kind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13936"
msgid "Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> He really is a nice boy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13948"
msgid "I don't think I can measure up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13960"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You've got that right. My son is a real "
"winner. <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13972"
msgid "Heheh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13984"
msgid "It's been a while, Kiryu-san! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13996"
msgid "Yeah, it has."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14008"
msgid "What have you been up to while I was away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14020"
msgid "Did you have fun drinking with the other girls?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14032"
msgid "That's a secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14044"
msgid "Heh. ♪ Is it now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14056"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14068"
msgid "Is it a secret because it's something you don't want me to hear?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14080"
msgid "Heh... Who knows..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14092"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I think I do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14104"
msgid ""
"You had fun drinking with other girls, but you won't say so because you're "
"trying to be considerate!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14116"
msgid "Am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14128"
msgid "...It's a secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14140"
msgid "Oh, yeah, we raised the roof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14152"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ I figured..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14164"
msgid "You aren't mad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14176"
msgid "It's fine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14188"
msgid "You had fun, right? I think that's great. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14200"
msgid "Are you really fine with that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14212"
msgid ""
"Yeah! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> How many times do I have to say it until "
"you believe me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14224"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14236"
msgid "I've been waiting for you this whole time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14248"
msgid "Huh!? Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14260"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14272"
msgid "I'm sorry. I wanted to come back sooner..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14284"
